items.source:
Remove any path extension from the <code>requestURI</code>. This method must be invoked before any calls to <a href="../../util/UriComponentsBuilder.html#path(java.lang.String)"><code>UriComponentsBuilder.path(String)</code></a>
or <a href="../../util/UriComponentsBuilder.html#pathSegment(java.lang.String...)"><code>UriComponentsBuilder.pathSegment(String...)</code></a>.
<pre>GET http://www.foo.example/rest/books/6.json

ServletUriComponentsBuilder builder = ServletUriComponentsBuilder.fromRequestUri(this.request);
String ext = builder.removePathExtension();
String uri = builder.path("/pages/1.{ext}").buildAndExpand(ext).toUriString();
assertEquals("http://www.foo.example/rest/books/6/pages/1.json", result);
</pre>

